 restaurants.","genres":["Series","Documentary"]},{"id":"ftv_GordonRamsaysHellsKitchen_us","title":"Hell's Kitchen","released":"2026-11-28T16:30:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T16:30:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T17:30:00Z","overview":"The chefs must cook eggs four different ways. The winners take a helicopter tour of L.A. while the losers unload, gut and fillet a large tuna.","genres":["Series","Documentary"]},{"id":"ftv_GordonRamsaysHellsKitchen_us","title":"Hell's Kitchen","released":"2026-11-28T17:30:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T17:30:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T18:30:00Z","overview":"With an emphasis on teamwork, Chef Ramsay challenges the teams to serve lunch to members of the USC Trojans marching band. The chefs cook burgers, salads and fries.","genres":["Series","Documentary"]},{"id":"ftv_GordonRamsaysHellsKitchen_us","title":"Hell's Kitchen","released":"2026-11-28T18:30:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T18:30:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T19:30:00Z","overview":"The remaining chefs must roll the dice to determine their next ingredients. The winning team enjoys a thrilling wind tunnel experience while the losers clean up.","genres":["Series","Documentary"]},{"id":"ftv_GordonRamsaysHellsKitchen_us","title":"Hell's Kitchen","released":"2026-11-28T19:30:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T19:30:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T20:30:00Z","overview":"The chefs must prepare dishes consisting of pork cuts and side items. Chef Ramsay surprises the contestants with the first-ever \"Hell's Kitchen\" barbecue.","genres":["Series","Documentary"]},{"id":"ftv_GordonRamsaysHellsKitchen_us","title":"Hell's Kitchen","released":"2026-11-28T20:30:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T20:30:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T21:30:00Z","overview":"The remaining chefs must make meals out of the five “mother sauces” without reusing any of the other twenty ingredients. The winning team gets to visit an English pub.","genres":["Series","Documentary"]},{"id":"ftv_GordonRamsaysHellsKitchen_us","title":"Hell's Kitchen","released":"2026-11-28T21:30:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T21:30:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T22:30:00Z","overview":"For the season's seventh dinner service, “Hell's Kitchen” hosts a fiftieth wedding anniversary. The chefs must update the classic dishes served at the original wedding reception.","genres":["Series","Documentary"]},{"id":"ftv_GordonRamsaysHellsKitchen_us","title":"Hell's Kitchen","released":"2026-11-28T22:30:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T22:30:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T23:30:00Z","overview":"The aspiring chefs must make unique sandwiches. The winners spend a day in California's wine country while the losers grind the peanuts for the next day's dinner service.","genres":["Series","Documentary"]},{"id":"ftv_GordonRamsaysHellsKitchen_us","title":"Hell's Kitchen","released":"2026-11-28T23:30:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T23:30:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-29T00:30:00Z","overview":"Chef Ramsay tests the remaining chefs' palates in a blind taste test. The winning team enjoys a day at Sea World while the losers unload deliveries of trout.","genres":["Series","Documentary"]},{"id":"ftv_GordonRamsaysHellsKitchen_us","title":"Hell's Kitchen","released":"2026-11-29T00:30:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-29T00:30:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-29T01:30:00Z","overview":"The chefs must create unique lobster dishes to be judged by Michelin star chefs. The winners enjoy a visit to a caviar house, followed by a shopping spree.","genres":["Series","Documentary"]},{"id":"ftv_GordonRamsaysHellsKitchen_us","title":"Gordon Ramsay's Hell's Kitchen – Live","released":"2026-11-29T01:30:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-29T01:30:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-29T03:00:00Z","genres":["Docs & Lifestyle"]},{"id":"ftv_GordonRamsaysHellsKitchen_us","title":"Gordon Ramsay's Hell's Kitchen – Live","released":"2026-11-29T03:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-29T03:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-29T06:00:00Z","genres":["Docs & Lifestyle"]},{"id":"ftv_GordonRamsaysHellsKitchen_us","title":"Gordon Ramsay's Hell's Kitchen – Live","released":"20